1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,785
Is your sign the one

2
00:00:01,835 --> 00:00:04,629
that should take it easy today?

3
00:00:04,679 --> 00:00:06,189
Today, 30 October

4
00:00:06,239 --> 00:00:09,950
is a slower day for the Year of the Goat.

5
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:13,033
Today is an Ox day, and the Goat sits

6
00:00:13,083 --> 00:00:15,783
opposite it in the zodiac circle.

7
00:00:15,833 --> 00:00:18,117
Some days, things just don't

8
00:00:18,167 --> 00:00:19,950
go the way we planned.

9
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:21,617
And that's okay.

10
00:00:21,667 --> 00:00:24,533
Everyone has days like this.

11
00:00:24,583 --> 00:00:27,554
A quiet day is not a bad day.

12
00:00:27,604 --> 00:00:29,950
It is a day to breathe.

13
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:33,121
Be careful today: you can be indecisive

14
00:00:33,171 --> 00:00:35,560
or overly dependent on others.

15
00:00:35,610 --> 00:00:37,836
Notice it, and give yourself

16
00:00:37,886 --> 00:00:39,950
a moment before you react.

17
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:43,492
Be gentle with the people you love

18
00:00:43,542 --> 00:00:45,367
and with yourself.

19
00:00:45,417 --> 00:00:47,033
Today the Rabbit

20
00:00:47,083 --> 00:00:49,950
is a good friend to lean on.

21
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:52,700
At work and with money

22
00:00:52,750 --> 00:00:55,950
take small, careful steps.

23
00:00:56,000 --> 00:00:59,950
Finish one thing, then the next.

24
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:02,712
Slow is still moving forward.

25
00:01:02,762 --> 00:01:05,950
Every quiet day makes you stronger

26
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:07,569
and brighter days

27
00:01:07,619 --> 00:01:09,950
are already on their way.

28
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:12,750
My tip: slow down, rest well

29
00:01:12,800 --> 00:01:15,650
and don't rush big decisions.

30
00:01:15,700 --> 00:01:17,750
Tomorrow is a new day

31
00:01:17,800 --> 00:01:19,950
and it could be yours.
